    <item>
      <title>Diffusion Models | Problems and Fixes</title>
      <link>https://blog.charliie.dev/page/diffusion-models/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 22 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://blog.charliie.dev/page/diffusion-models/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;p&gt;Notes from reading Lilian Weng&amp;rsquo;s &amp;ldquo;What are Diffusion Models?&amp;rdquo;.&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; They skip the basics of the
forward and reverse processes, which her post explains well, and keep to the problems diffusion
models ran into and what fixed each one. Sources are collected at the bottom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;why-diffusion-models&#34;&gt;Why diffusion models&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;why-diffusion-models&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#why-diffusion-models&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Generative models usually trade &lt;strong&gt;tractability&lt;/strong&gt; against &lt;strong&gt;flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;. Tractable models, such
as a Gaussian or a Laplace distribution, can be evaluated analytically and fitted cheaply, but
they cannot describe the structure of rich data. Flexible models can fit arbitrary structure, but
evaluating, training or sampling from them is expensive. Diffusion models manage both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The price is speed: a sample comes out of a long Markov chain of denoising steps, so generation is
slow in time and compute. Faster samplers exist, but sampling is still slower than with a GAN.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;relation-to-score-based-models&#34;&gt;Relation to score-based models&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;relation-to-score-based-models&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#relation-to-score-based-models&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Diffusion models are closely related to noise-conditioned score networks (NCSN), which learn the
score, the gradient of the data&amp;rsquo;s log density.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimating the score.&lt;/strong&gt; Denoising score matching&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:2&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:2&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; and sliced score matching, which uses
random projections,&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:3&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:3&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; make the score learnable from data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stabilising training.&lt;/strong&gt; Adding a small Gaussian noise spreads the data distribution over the
whole space &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=&#34;double-struck&#34;&gt;R&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;D&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;\mathbb{R}^D&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8413em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathbb&#34;&gt;R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8413em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0278em;&#34;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, which makes training the score estimator more stable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Many noise levels.&lt;/strong&gt; Song and Ermon perturbed the data with noise at several levels and
trained one noise-conditioned network to estimate the scores at all of them jointly.&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:4&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:4&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;training&#34;&gt;Training&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;training&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#training&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;log-likelihood-lagged-behind-other-generative-models&#34;&gt;Log-likelihood lagged behind other generative models&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;log-likelihood-lagged-behind-other-generative-models&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#log-likelihood-lagged-behind-other-generative-models&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem.&lt;/strong&gt; Diffusion models could not reach the log-likelihood of competing generative models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix.&lt;/strong&gt; Several training improvements, the best known being a cosine-based variance schedule for
&lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;β&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;t&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;\beta_t&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0528em;&#34;&gt;β&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t vlist-t2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.2806em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34;&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-s&#34;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.15em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:5&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:5&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; The exact function matters less than its shape: it should drop almost
linearly in the middle of the process and change only subtly near &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;t&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mn&gt;0&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;t = 0&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6151em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34;&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6444em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;t&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;T&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;t = T&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6151em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34;&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6833em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.1389em;&#34;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;learning-the-reverse-variance-was-unstable&#34;&gt;Learning the reverse variance was unstable&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;learning-the-reverse-variance-was-unstable&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#learning-the-reverse-variance-was-unstable&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem.&lt;/strong&gt; Learning a diagonal variance &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=&#34;normal&#34;&gt;Σ&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;θ&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;\Sigma_\theta&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;Σ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t vlist-t2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.3361em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0278em;&#34;&gt;θ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-s&#34;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.15em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; for the reverse process led to unstable
training and worse samples.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix.&lt;/strong&gt; Ho et al. kept &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;β&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;t&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;\beta_t&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0528em;&#34;&gt;β&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t vlist-t2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.2806em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34;&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-s&#34;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.15em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; as fixed constants instead of learning them and set
&lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=&#34;normal&#34;&gt;Σ&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;θ&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&#34;false&#34;&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;x&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;t&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo separator=&#34;true&#34;&gt;,&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;t&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&#34;false&#34;&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msubsup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;σ&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;t&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mn&gt;2&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/msubsup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;I&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;\Sigma_\theta(x_t, t) = \sigma_t^2 I&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;Σ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t vlist-t2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.3361em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0278em;&#34;&gt;θ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-s&#34;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.15em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mopen&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t vlist-t2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.2806em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34;&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-s&#34;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.15em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mpunct&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.1667em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34;&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mclose&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:1.0611em;vertical-align:-0.247em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0359em;&#34;&gt;σ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t vlist-t2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8141em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34;&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mtight&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-s&#34;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.247em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0785em;&#34;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:6&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:6&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;sampling&#34;&gt;Sampling&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;sampling&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#sampling&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem.&lt;/strong&gt; Sampling from a DDPM follows the reverse Markov chain step by step, and &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;T&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;T&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6833em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.1389em;&#34;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; can be a
thousand steps or more. Song et al. put a number on it:&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:7&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:7&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;For example, it takes around 20 hours to sample 50k images of size 32 × 32 from a DDPM, but less
than a minute to do so from a GAN on an Nvidia 2080 Ti GPU.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two fixes took different routes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;skip-steps-ddim&#34;&gt;Skip steps: DDIM&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;skip-steps-ddim&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#skip-steps-ddim&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The denoising diffusion implicit model (DDIM) trains with any number of forward steps but samples
from only a subset of them.&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref1:7&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:7&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; Compared with DDPM, it:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produces better samples with far fewer steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is &lt;strong&gt;consistent&lt;/strong&gt;: generation is deterministic, so samples from the same latent share their
high-level features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thanks to that consistency, interpolates meaningfully in the latent space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;diffuse-less-data-latent-diffusion&#34;&gt;Diffuse less data: latent diffusion&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;diffuse-less-data-latent-diffusion&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#diffuse-less-data-latent-diffusion&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The latent diffusion model (LDM) runs diffusion in a learned latent space instead of pixel space,
which makes both training and inference cheaper.&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:8&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:8&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; It rests on an observation: most bits of an
image encode perceptual detail, while the semantic composition survives aggressive compression.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So LDM splits the work in two:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perceptual compression.&lt;/strong&gt; An autoencoder removes pixel-level redundancy. The encoder &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;E&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;E&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6833em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0576em;&#34;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
maps an image &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;x&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;∈&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=&#34;double-struck&#34;&gt;R&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;H&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;×&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;W&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;×&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mn&gt;3&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;x \in \mathbb{R}^{H \times W \times 3}&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;∈&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8413em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathbb&#34;&gt;R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8413em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0813em;&#34;&gt;H&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mbin mtight&#34;&gt;×&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.1389em;&#34;&gt;W&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mbin mtight&#34;&gt;×&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mtight&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to a smaller latent
&lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;z&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;E&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&#34;false&#34;&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;x&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&#34;false&#34;&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mo&gt;∈&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=&#34;double-struck&#34;&gt;R&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;h&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;×&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;w&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;×&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;c&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;z = E(x) \in \mathbb{R}^{h \times w \times c}&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.4306em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.044em;&#34;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0576em;&#34;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mopen&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mclose&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;∈&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8491em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathbb&#34;&gt;R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8491em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34;&gt;h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mbin mtight&#34;&gt;×&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0269em;&#34;&gt;w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mbin mtight&#34;&gt;×&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, downsampling by &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;f&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;H&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=&#34;normal&#34;&gt;/&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;h&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;W&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=&#34;normal&#34;&gt;/&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;w&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mn&gt;2&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;mi&gt;m&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;f = H/h = W/w = 2^m&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.1076em;&#34;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0813em;&#34;&gt;H&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34;&gt;h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.1389em;&#34;&gt;W&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0269em;&#34;&gt;w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6644em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;msupsub&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6644em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:2.7em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal mtight&#34;&gt;m&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, and
the decoder &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;D&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;D&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6833em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0278em;&#34;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; reconstructs &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mover accent=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;x&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;^&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mover&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;D&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&#34;false&#34;&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;z&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&#34;false&#34;&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;\hat{x} = D(z)&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6944em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord katex-accent&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-t&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist-r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vlist&#34; style=&#34;height:0.6944em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-3em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:3em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;top:-3em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;pstrut&#34; style=&#34;height:3em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;accent-body&#34; style=&#34;left:-0.2222em;&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord&#34;&gt;^&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mrel&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mspace&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.2778em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.0278em;&#34;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mopen&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.044em;&#34;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mclose&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. To keep the latent&amp;rsquo;s variance in check, the
paper tries two regularisers: a small KL penalty towards a standard normal, as in a VAE, and a
vector-quantisation layer absorbed into the decoder, as in VQ-VAE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Semantic generation.&lt;/strong&gt; Diffusion and denoising happen on &lt;span class=&#34;katex&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-mathml&#34;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&#34;&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;z&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding=&#34;application/x-tex&#34;&gt;z&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-html&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-base&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;katex-strut&#34; style=&#34;height:0.4306em;&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mord mathnormal&#34; style=&#34;margin-right:0.044em;&#34;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. The denoiser is a
time-conditioned U-Net with &lt;strong&gt;cross-attention&lt;/strong&gt;, which lets it take conditioning of any kind,
such as class labels, semantic maps or a blurred version of the image, by fusing the other
modality&amp;rsquo;s representation into the network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;footnotes&#34; role=&#34;doc-endnotes&#34;&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li id=&#34;fn:1&#34;&gt;
